    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3174040/extras/3dcc153fa3e9a6b141f633e4aca21329.avif?t=1749557302\" data-has-big width=800 height=449 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ABOUT THE GAME</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Intercolonies </strong>is a simulation-adventure game set in a post-apocalyptic world where you transport passengers between colonies while fighting for survival. Abandoned structures, treacherous roads, and unknown enemies make every step in this world a challenge. Customize your vehicle and make strategic decisions to safely deliver your passengers to their destination.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3174040/extras/75c152aeb8d73a8ef833bb9ddd2fdfc3.poster.avif?t=1749557302\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3174040/extras/75c152aeb8d73a8ef833bb9ddd2fdfc3.webm?t=1749557302\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3174040/extras/75c152aeb8d73a8ef833bb9ddd2fdfc3.mp4?t=1749557302\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's <strong>your responsibility</strong> to transport passengers between colonies in an environment dominated by <strong>dangerous</strong> roads and <strong>harsh biomes</strong>. Each journey requires you to strategize to survive.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3174040/extras/b3e16da5865f4478221eca50c0149d3d.poster.avif?t=1749557302\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3174040/extras/b3e16da5865f4478221eca50c0149d3d.webm?t=1749557302\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3174040/extras/b3e16da5865f4478221eca50c0149d3d.mp4?t=1749557302\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the post-apocalyptic world, <strong>customizing</strong> your vehicle to deal with the challenges of biomes is an important requirement. You can make dangerous roads safer by choosing <strong>suitable</strong> wheels for different terrains. You can <strong>reflect</strong> your style by changing the color of your vehicle and reveal your identity by personalizing your license plate. With modifications that will <strong>increase</strong> engine power, you can gain <strong>speed</strong> and <strong>durability</strong> in difficult conditions. Each customization offers a significant advantage in your fight for survival!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3174040/extras/536f14987c346e7bf588ebf08886ddbc.poster.avif?t=1749557302\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3174040/extras/536f14987c346e7bf588ebf08886ddbc.webm?t=1749557302\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3174040/extras/536f14987c346e7bf588ebf08886ddbc.mp4?t=1749557302\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Exploring</strong> the environment is the key to survival. Different biomes are full of hidden resources and surprises. Each exploration offers new <strong>challenges</strong> and <strong>opportunities</strong>. Be careful in dangerous areas; you may encounter enemies. By exploring the environment, you can find the necessary materials to survive and develop your strategies. With your explorations, you <strong>gain</strong> experience and write your own story!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3174040/extras/53b08aaf09863ecf419b251fbe2444f1.poster.avif?t=1749557302\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3174040/extras/53b08aaf09863ecf419b251fbe2444f1.webm?t=1749557302\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3174040/extras/53b08aaf09863ecf419b251fbe2444f1.mp4?t=1749557302\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will encounter <strong>bandits</strong> and various threats that will try to stop you. It is important to think strategically and develop quick reflexes to <strong>defeat</strong> the enemies. Each conflict offers opportunities that will increase your chances of survival.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3174040/extras/3dcc153fa3e9a6b141f633e4aca21329.avif?t=1749557302\" data-has-big width=800 height=449 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ABOUT THE GAME</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Intercolonies </strong>is a simulation-adventure game set in a post-apocalyptic world where you transport passengers between colonies while fighting for survival. Abandoned structures, treacherous roads, and unknown enemies make every step in this world a challenge. Customize your vehicle and make strategic decisions to safely deliver your passengers to their destination.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3174040/extras/75c152aeb8d73a8ef833bb9ddd2fdfc3.poster.avif?t=1749557302\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3174040/extras/75c152aeb8d73a8ef833bb9ddd2fdfc3.webm?t=1749557302\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3174040/extras/75c152aeb8d73a8ef833bb9ddd2fdfc3.mp4?t=1749557302\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's <strong>your responsibility</strong> to transport passengers between colonies in an environment dominated by <strong>dangerous</strong> roads and <strong>harsh biomes</strong>. Each journey requires you to strategize to survive.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3174040/extras/b3e16da5865f4478221eca50c0149d3d.poster.avif?t=1749557302\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3174040/extras/b3e16da5865f4478221eca50c0149d3d.webm?t=1749557302\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3174040/extras/b3e16da5865f4478221eca50c0149d3d.mp4?t=1749557302\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the post-apocalyptic world, <strong>customizing</strong> your vehicle to deal with the challenges of biomes is an important requirement. You can make dangerous roads safer by choosing <strong>suitable</strong> wheels for different terrains. You can <strong>reflect</strong> your style by changing the color of your vehicle and reveal your identity by personalizing your license plate. With modifications that will <strong>increase</strong> engine power, you can gain <strong>speed</strong> and <strong>durability</strong> in difficult conditions. Each customization offers a significant advantage in your fight for survival!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3174040/extras/536f14987c346e7bf588ebf08886ddbc.poster.avif?t=1749557302\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3174040/extras/536f14987c346e7bf588ebf08886ddbc.webm?t=1749557302\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3174040/extras/536f14987c346e7bf588ebf08886ddbc.mp4?t=1749557302\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Exploring</strong> the environment is the key to survival. Different biomes are full of hidden resources and surprises. Each exploration offers new <strong>challenges</strong> and <strong>opportunities</strong>. Be careful in dangerous areas; you may encounter enemies. By exploring the environment, you can find the necessary materials to survive and develop your strategies. With your explorations, you <strong>gain</strong> experience and write your own story!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3174040/extras/53b08aaf09863ecf419b251fbe2444f1.poster.avif?t=1749557302\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3174040/extras/53b08aaf09863ecf419b251fbe2444f1.webm?t=1749557302\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3174040/extras/53b08aaf09863ecf419b251fbe2444f1.mp4?t=1749557302\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will encounter <strong>bandits</strong> and various threats that will try to stop you. It is important to think strategically and develop quick reflexes to <strong>defeat</strong> the enemies. Each conflict offers opportunities that will increase your chances of survival.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "short_description": "Intercolonies is an exciting simulation-adventure game set in a post-apocalyptic world. Navigate dangerous roads to transport passengers between colonies, customize your vehicle, and protect those you carry from all sorts of threats. Explore different biomes and develop smart strategies to survive.",
